{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824190/extras/hearts3.png?t=1759486091\" /></span><strong>MEET ZELIA!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Zelia, the fearless huntress whose natural charm strikes just as true as her spear. Don't worry, you won't need to join her on the hunt. The big catch is already made, and the whole village is preparing for a feast. Even Zelia has dressed up in a straw skirt and flower garlands. She's ready to throw you a real celebration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zelia loves bringing pleasure to herself and her partner, slowly sliding down onto a cock, then squeezing it gently inside her. To perfect this art, Zelia trains every day with a jade egg and other enticing little toys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824190/extras/down_bar_small.png?t=1759486091\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824190/extras/hearts3.png?t=1759486091\" /></span><strong>WHAT YOU'RE GETTING?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock Zelia in her playful tease outfit. You can switch mascots anytime by opening your profile in-game and selecting the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with the mascot, you'll also receive 5000 Credits and 150 Super Serum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But most importantly, you'll have our heartfelt thanks! We truly appreciate your support and hope you enjoy this DLC!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3824190?t=1759486091","background_raw":"https:/